### Create accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Accept: */*
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "Yusuf Manshur",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Get account by id
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/1
Accept: */*

### List accounts
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts?page_id=1&page_size=5
Accept: */*